          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Demonstrated political‑military cohesion among states supporting Ukraine produces expedited policy alignment and burden‑sharing pledges that are extended into Indo‑Pacific partnerships (e.g., joint exercises, basing access, arms transfers), directly strengthening the stated durability and operational clarity of regional commitments." />
