          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Visible Russian strikes on energy and transport nodes that increase perceived sovereign and project risk lead insurers, export credit agencies and lenders to reprice or tighten coverage for comparable port, pipeline and grid projects in the Indo‑Pacific, directly constraining available financing and raising conditions." />
