          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute attacks or interdictions raise sudden uncertainty about energy flows and insurance/FX exposures, triggering rapid repositioning and heavier, more erratic trading in sovereign bonds which increases realized and implied bond-market volatility." />
