          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in tanker attacks or interdictions precipitates immediate naval escorts, interdiction/retaliation operations and bilateral military encounters that directly raise the propensity for incidents in the Indo‑Pacific to escalate into broader crises." />
