          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in attacks or interdictions against merchant shipping creates immediate domestic and parliamentary pressure in supporting states to bolster naval and related defence budgets, increasing available defense funding that can be applied to Ukraine-related capabilities." />
