          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in deployments to protect energy corridors trigger formal assurance measures, burden‑sharing negotiations and visible capability rotations with Indo‑Pacific partners, consolidating and clarifying alliance commitments." />
