          <attvalue for="34" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising long-term benchmark yields directly raise the cost of borrowing and debt-service for sovereigns and project sponsors, making capital for large infrastructure and energy projects more expensive or conditional and therefore tightening financing availability in the Indo‑Pacific." />
