          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger, clearer alliance commitments increase the propensity and speed of coordinated releases of strategic petroleum reserves and reciprocal stock sharing among partners to stabilize allied markets." />
