          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="If major powers (principally the US) deepen and clarify security commitments toward Indo‑Pacific partners, political and burden‑sharing tensions will rise among Euro‑Atlantic partners as they disagree over prioritization, reducing coordinated political and military alignment on Ukraine." />
