          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter availability and cost of project and infrastructure finance forces banks to extend liquidity support, mark loans and absorb delayed cashflows on sponsored projects, degrading balance-sheet liquidity and elevating funding strain." />
